    {
      "prompt": "In D2, look up the product name for SKU S103: =VLOOKUP(B2, $I$2:$L$9, 2, FALSE).",
      "teach": "**VLOOKUP(lookup_value, table, column_number, FALSE)** finds the lookup value in the **first column** of the table, then goes across to the column you name and brings back what's there.\n\n- **B2:** the SKU to find.\n- **$I$2:$L$9:** the product list, locked with $ so it doesn't move when copied.\n- **2:** bring back the 2nd column of that table (Product).\n- **FALSE:** exact match only.",
